WEBVTT

01:30.890 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.070 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 4]

01:43.680 --> 01:44.320
Mr. Chang.

01:44.640 --> 01:45.770
You've worked hard.

01:45.950 --> 01:47.350
I had heard before coming

01:47.350 --> 01:48.710
that the matters you handled
beyond the pass

01:48.710 --> 01:49.770
went smoothly.

01:50.350 --> 01:52.840
Please allow me to express my respects.

01:53.759 --> 01:54.960
Thank you for asking.

01:55.710 --> 01:57.920
Finally made it back before the New Year.

01:57.920 --> 01:58.729
Tonight,

01:58.920 --> 02:00.120
I'll treat everyone.

02:00.400 --> 02:02.350
We have matters of great importance,

02:02.350 --> 02:04.080
but no need to bring them up now.

02:04.200 --> 02:06.000
The government offices are already closed.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.460
After the Lantern Festival,
I'll have Heizi

02:08.470 --> 02:10.630
go to the draft bank
to settle the accounts.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.430
If you have anything else to ask,

02:12.680 --> 02:13.940
go ahead and say it all.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.800
I wouldn't dare. I wouldn't dare.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.150
You're a respected senior.

02:17.150 --> 02:19.000
If there's anything you need,
just give the word.

02:19.000 --> 02:21.730
I'll come to your residence anytime
to serve you.

02:23.840 --> 02:24.520
Old Chang.

02:25.400 --> 02:26.470
When are you going to return

02:26.470 --> 02:27.520
the two acres of salt fields

02:27.520 --> 02:29.120
you stole from my ancestors?

02:29.280 --> 02:30.400
You old coffin stuffing,

02:30.400 --> 02:31.590
I'm talking to you!

02:32.400 --> 02:34.530
You mean
those two acres of salt fields

02:34.710 --> 02:35.590
belong to your family?

02:35.590 --> 02:36.210
Yeah!

02:36.470 --> 02:37.630
They belong to my family,

02:37.630 --> 02:38.590
to my ancestors,

02:38.710 --> 02:39.770
to my forefathers!

02:39.870 --> 02:41.190
They've been ours since the Ming Dynasty.

02:41.190 --> 02:42.079
You stole them!

02:42.150 --> 02:43.470
You robbed them!

02:46.630 --> 02:48.290
Hey, what are you smirking at?

02:49.750 --> 02:50.940
I'm smirking because...

02:50.940 --> 02:52.270
Buddy, you're so smart.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.150
So those two acres of salt fields
really belong to your family?

02:54.150 --> 02:55.630
Do you think I, Li Laizi,

02:55.680 --> 02:56.880
would lie about this?

02:57.150 --> 02:58.380
So who did Mr. Chang buy

02:58.380 --> 02:59.560
those two acres of salt fields from?

02:59.560 --> 03:01.150
From the government, of course.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.240
Well, in that case.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.470
even if they need to be returned,

03:04.470 --> 03:05.910
Mr. Chang should return them
to the government,

03:05.910 --> 03:07.030
and you should then claim them
from the government.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.190
That's the proper way to handle it.

03:08.190 --> 03:09.300
Since when

03:09.320 --> 03:10.410
does this concern you?

03:10.410 --> 03:11.890
Mind your own business!

03:11.920 --> 03:12.630
Tell me.

03:12.790 --> 03:13.970
If someone surnamed Zhu

03:13.970 --> 03:14.840
suddenly appears,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.730
claiming everything under heaven
belongs to his family,

03:16.730 --> 03:18.800
would His Majesty give it to him

03:19.000 --> 03:20.070
or not?

03:21.740 --> 03:23.260
You keep

03:23.300 --> 03:25.620
demanding your ancestral property
from the Ming Dynasty.

03:25.620 --> 03:27.970
So enthusiastic about
the previous dynasty—

03:27.970 --> 03:28.650
Mr. Chang,

03:29.310 --> 03:30.370
I think this person

03:30.829 --> 03:31.730
looks like a rebel.

03:31.730 --> 03:32.850
W-Who are you calling a rebel?

03:32.850 --> 03:34.110
You've got some nerve.

03:34.920 --> 03:36.050
You're trying to restore the old order

03:36.050 --> 03:37.710
and overthrow the current one.

03:37.710 --> 03:38.310
Mr. Chang,

03:38.410 --> 03:39.490
let's write a petition

03:39.490 --> 03:41.140
and send it to the magistrate.

03:41.140 --> 03:42.150
Let's make it an imperial case,

03:42.150 --> 03:43.360
have him escorted to the capital

03:43.360 --> 03:45.030
and flayed alive at Caishikou.

03:45.030 --> 03:45.700
Wait.

03:45.800 --> 03:47.400
Y-You're talking nonsense.

03:47.579 --> 03:49.310
W-Why should I be flayed alive?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.920
You dare to sue over goods

03:50.920 --> 03:52.380
sold by the government,

03:52.850 --> 03:54.570
claiming they were stolen or robbed
from you.

03:54.570 --> 03:55.490
That equals calling

03:55.490 --> 03:56.820
the government a thief.

03:57.150 --> 03:58.150
Good heavens.

03:58.740 --> 03:59.860
With that one remark,

03:59.860 --> 04:01.560
you've insulted all the emperors
of the Qing Dynasty

04:01.560 --> 04:02.610
since they entered the pass

04:02.610 --> 04:04.100
and established their rule.

04:04.100 --> 04:06.160
Who should be flayed alive if not you?

04:06.850 --> 04:07.730
No, no.

04:07.750 --> 04:08.540
T-There's something so serious

04:08.540 --> 04:09.660
behind this?

04:20.190 --> 04:22.270
Wang Tiangui is setting me up!

04:23.090 --> 04:24.290
Don't talk nonsense.

04:24.310 --> 04:24.970
What does this have to do

04:24.970 --> 04:25.900
with our master?

04:26.090 --> 04:26.430
Hey.

04:26.700 --> 04:27.990
You had me do you a favor,

04:27.990 --> 04:29.280
paid me a few lousy coins,

04:29.280 --> 04:31.340
and nearly got me flayed alive for it.

04:32.560 --> 04:34.370
You heartless lot!

04:34.860 --> 04:36.560
J-Just you wait!

04:36.750 --> 04:37.970
This isn't over!

04:40.740 --> 04:42.070
And the magistrate

04:42.100 --> 04:43.820
is backing this kind of rebel?

04:44.720 --> 04:45.900
After the Lantern Festival,

04:45.900 --> 04:47.890
I think it's best
to file a formal complaint

04:47.890 --> 04:49.090
and get some answers.

04:54.970 --> 04:55.810
Young man,

04:56.560 --> 04:58.690
may I ask who you are?

04:59.190 --> 05:01.160
He's my distant nephew.

05:01.830 --> 05:03.430
On this trip beyond the pass,

05:03.490 --> 05:04.620
he knew the way well,

05:04.940 --> 05:06.240
so I brought him back with me.

05:06.240 --> 05:08.190
From now on, he'll be

05:08.210 --> 05:10.270
more involved in our family affairs.

05:10.480 --> 05:11.880
Sir, you don't sound like

05:12.190 --> 05:13.430
a local.

05:13.950 --> 05:16.510
You have a bit of a Huaiyang accent.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.120
Yes.

05:18.730 --> 05:19.730
I'm from Huizhou.

05:20.430 --> 05:21.400
I wasn't any good at studying,

05:21.400 --> 05:23.260
so I'm now learning business
from Mr. Chang.

05:23.260 --> 05:25.260
Please kindly offer your guidance.

05:27.510 --> 05:28.190
Certainly.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.540
With pleasure.

05:30.980 --> 05:32.300
I came here today

05:33.159 --> 05:34.990
specially for this agreement.

05:40.380 --> 05:41.909
You should know

05:42.000 --> 05:43.670
the rules of draft banks, Mr. Chang.

05:43.670 --> 05:45.310
Money is like an iron threshold,

05:45.310 --> 05:47.180
and people are like the filling in a bun.

05:47.180 --> 05:49.210
Doesn't matter whether it's the New Year
or not—

05:49.210 --> 05:50.250
when it's due,

05:52.810 --> 05:54.710
it must be paid.

05:55.750 --> 05:57.320
I just arrived,

05:57.550 --> 05:59.950
and you're already here collecting debts.

06:00.500 --> 06:01.630
Even the King of Hell

06:01.630 --> 06:02.960
doesn't rush like this.

06:05.070 --> 06:06.240
Heizi has already

06:06.260 --> 06:07.310
settled the accounts today.

06:07.310 --> 06:09.120
The silver ingots are sitting right there.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.040
Tell Wang Tiangui

06:10.040 --> 06:11.560
to come get the money himself
with his cart.

06:11.560 --> 06:12.480
I'm off to have a drink

06:12.480 --> 06:13.340
with my men.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.950
Mr. Chang. Mr. Chang.

06:14.950 --> 06:15.720
Mr. Chang!

06:15.740 --> 06:16.670
Hold on a moment.

06:17.390 --> 06:18.190
Mr. Chang.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.450
Please take a good look.

06:20.930 --> 06:22.220
[Borrowed 1,000 taels in full
under Wang Tiangui's name by agreement]

06:21.160 --> 06:22.120
That money

06:22.830 --> 06:23.630
is not enough.

06:25.070 --> 06:26.020
How much short?

06:26.160 --> 06:27.680
I'll run a couple extra loads
after the New Year to cover it.

06:27.580 --> 06:29.370
[Loan Agreement]
[Borrower: Chang Si, Lender: Wang Tiangui]

06:28.090 --> 06:29.620
Just charge interest on it.

06:29.870 --> 06:31.950
Giving me trouble at a time like this,

06:32.680 --> 06:33.370
do you think it's fun?

06:33.370 --> 06:38.750
[Loan Agreement]
[Borrower: Chang Si, Lender: Wang Tiangui]

06:33.920 --> 06:34.770
Mr. Chang.

06:35.220 --> 06:37.380
I wouldn't dare cause you trouble.

06:37.830 --> 06:39.159
Please look carefully.

06:39.159 --> 06:40.510
This agreement states

06:41.150 --> 06:44.030
it was established at
the magistrate office last October.

06:44.030 --> 06:47.210
[5% interest, interest compounds,
repayment due within this year][Stated]

06:44.100 --> 06:45.990
His Worship vouched for it himself.

06:45.990 --> 06:47.270
The interest is 5%,

06:47.360 --> 06:48.630
and it compounds.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.560
Besides,

06:50.180 --> 06:52.310
if it isn't repaid in full
within this year,

06:52.310 --> 06:55.159
your house will be mortgaged to Master.

06:56.150 --> 06:58.600
Even if it's short by the slightest bit,

06:58.630 --> 07:00.830
it will still be considered unsettled.

07:06.270 --> 07:07.700
[If not repaid in full within this year,
ancestral house mortgaged to Wang Tiangui]

07:18.510 --> 07:19.430
Mr. Chang.

07:20.100 --> 07:22.410
I'm only here to get your clear answer.

07:23.340 --> 07:24.600
If you agree,

07:24.920 --> 07:27.920
I'll have someone come by tomorrow
to clear out your house for you.

07:27.920 --> 07:28.980
Master

07:29.040 --> 07:30.930
wants to spend the New Year here.

07:31.820 --> 07:33.020
If you don't agree,

07:33.050 --> 07:34.310
I'll leave right away.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.750
Tomorrow, His Worship

07:35.750 --> 07:37.950
will send people here to seal your door.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.220
So,

07:39.270 --> 07:41.110
what would you like me

07:41.159 --> 07:42.220
to tell Master?

07:44.070 --> 07:45.480
In this freezing weather

07:45.650 --> 07:46.960
and during the New Year period,

07:46.960 --> 07:48.310
where do you expect me to stay?

07:48.310 --> 07:49.310
Out on the street?

07:49.720 --> 07:50.770
Mr. Chang, well,

07:50.890 --> 07:53.350
I can't think of any solution for you.

07:55.680 --> 07:56.610
What's the rush?

07:56.810 --> 07:57.820
It's not due yet.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.990
What do you mean it isn't due?

08:02.150 --> 08:03.480
It's stated right here,

08:03.810 --> 08:05.230
"within this year."

08:06.500 --> 08:08.430
It's only New Year's Eve tomorrow.

08:08.910 --> 08:10.190
Any day before the first day
of the New Year

08:10.190 --> 08:11.650
still counts as this year.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.560
So what?

08:21.870 --> 08:23.040
The shops are all boarded up

08:23.040 --> 08:24.490
and the government offices are all sealed.

08:24.490 --> 08:26.490
What, do you shit gold or piss silver

08:26.520 --> 08:28.600
so you can just produce money
out of nowhere?

08:28.600 --> 08:29.630
Do we have to throw you out
onto the street

08:29.630 --> 08:30.750
on New Year's Eve?

08:30.800 --> 08:31.800
Is that what you want?

08:31.800 --> 08:33.730
That's how the agreement was made.

08:34.190 --> 08:36.450
It's written in black and white on paper.

08:37.240 --> 08:37.990
Butler.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.510
Just do as it says.

08:40.150 --> 08:41.150
Please leave now.

08:41.270 --> 08:41.750
You...

08:45.620 --> 08:46.270
Fine.

08:46.310 --> 08:47.190
Fine.

08:48.310 --> 08:50.320
I'll give you one more day.

08:50.590 --> 08:51.710
I'd like to see

08:51.840 --> 08:52.880
how this money

08:53.110 --> 08:55.050
will fall from the sky!

09:03.910 --> 09:05.700
I'm so useless.

09:05.840 --> 09:07.640
I fell into Wang Tiangui's trap.

09:08.010 --> 09:09.520
I'm such a fool.

09:10.630 --> 09:12.360
I'm probably the dumbest person

09:12.360 --> 09:13.480
in this world.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.000
Mr. Chang,

09:14.000 --> 09:15.370
now is not the time for self-blame.

09:15.370 --> 09:16.770
Let's discuss what to do.

09:16.870 --> 09:18.440
What's there to discuss?

09:20.890 --> 09:23.310
Distant nephew my foot.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.320
Chang Si's family

09:25.390 --> 09:27.670
has always been small.

09:27.700 --> 09:29.770
I've never heard of

09:29.840 --> 09:31.320
any young members.

09:31.950 --> 09:32.840
That Old Chang

09:32.870 --> 09:34.180
was quick to explain.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.450
It's obvious he was hiding something.

09:36.450 --> 09:37.870
He said this youngster

09:38.080 --> 09:39.620
knew the way beyond the pass,

09:39.620 --> 09:41.270
and he's teaching him how to do business.

09:41.270 --> 09:42.570
If you ask me, that person

09:42.570 --> 09:44.400
doesn't seem like a scholar,

09:44.430 --> 09:45.390
but he doesn't

09:45.440 --> 09:46.660
look like a merchant either.

09:46.660 --> 09:49.490
70% scholarly, 30% rogue.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.380
He has a Huaiyang accent,

09:53.000 --> 09:54.750
but it will take some time

09:54.780 --> 09:55.990
to verify.

09:58.980 --> 10:00.270
Keep investigating.

10:01.270 --> 10:02.120
Anyway,

10:02.140 --> 10:04.060
whoever dares to ruin my plans,

10:04.590 --> 10:06.590
I'll expose those monsters

10:06.790 --> 10:09.050
for what they truly are!

10:10.240 --> 10:11.370
Before the New Year,

10:11.720 --> 10:12.320
all our men

10:12.340 --> 10:13.660
returned safely.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.010
A toast to that!

10:15.080 --> 10:15.790
Cheers!

10:15.840 --> 10:16.750
Bottoms up!

10:16.770 --> 10:17.480
To Mr. Chang.

10:17.480 --> 10:18.270
Come on, to Mr. Chang!

10:18.270 --> 10:19.260
-To Mr. Chang.
-To Mr. Chang!

10:19.260 --> 10:20.520
Cheers! A toast to you.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.510
We'd like to toast you.

10:22.510 --> 10:22.970
Cheers.

10:23.240 --> 10:23.910
Bottoms up.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.910
Thank you for your hard work.

10:24.910 --> 10:25.840
Drink up.

10:26.550 --> 10:27.750
-Alright.
-Alright.

10:30.320 --> 10:30.980
Patriarch.

10:33.120 --> 10:33.790
Alright.

10:33.870 --> 10:34.910
Enjoy your drink.

10:34.930 --> 10:35.600
Father,

10:36.150 --> 10:37.620
take it easy with the drinking.

10:37.620 --> 10:39.290
Why are you trying to outdrink everyone?

10:39.290 --> 10:40.150
It's alright.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.220
Come on, Heizi.

10:41.440 --> 10:41.900
Come on.

10:42.750 --> 10:44.010
Let's go toast our men.

10:44.250 --> 10:45.310
Come on, fill it up.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.810
Come on, guys!

10:51.910 --> 10:54.270
-Mr. Chang.
-Mr. Chang.

10:54.270 --> 10:55.370
Mr. Chang is coming to toast us.

10:55.370 --> 10:56.420
-Come on.
-Guys!

10:56.550 --> 10:57.510
Time for a toast!

10:58.250 --> 10:58.810
Alright!

10:58.910 --> 10:59.510
See?

11:00.110 --> 11:01.400
It's the same every year.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.630
He always gets hammered on New Year's Eve.

11:03.630 --> 11:04.750
You've been with me for most of your life.

11:04.750 --> 11:06.810
In past years, he drank to celebrate.

11:07.080 --> 11:08.010
But this year...

11:08.390 --> 11:10.430
I'm afraid he'll get drunk a bit sooner.

11:10.430 --> 11:11.760
Those who joined later,

11:12.510 --> 11:13.910
working in the horse gang...

11:13.910 --> 11:14.770
What happened?

11:15.530 --> 11:17.090
Wang Tiangui's butler

11:17.240 --> 11:18.880
was here with an agreement,

11:19.510 --> 11:21.570
asking Mr. Chang to give up his house.

11:21.760 --> 11:23.150
Didn't we already pay him?

11:23.150 --> 11:24.800
We still owe 718 taels.

11:25.050 --> 11:26.390
I'll get Father back here.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.630
What's the use of
drowning his sorrows in alcohol?

11:27.630 --> 11:28.240
Sit.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.740
Do you have a solution?

11:31.230 --> 11:32.660
-No.
-Then why add to the trouble?

11:32.660 --> 11:33.750
Let's drink up together!

11:33.750 --> 11:35.210
-Bottoms up!
-Bottoms up!

11:36.440 --> 11:37.270
Come on, Heizi.

11:37.270 --> 11:37.890
Look.

11:38.950 --> 11:40.390
If Mr. Chang had any solution,

11:40.390 --> 11:41.440
why would he

11:41.480 --> 11:42.420
drink so much?

11:42.750 --> 11:44.730
Thank you all for your hard work, guys.

11:44.730 --> 11:46.730
I'll drink first to show my respect.

11:47.270 --> 11:47.870
Come on, drink up.

11:47.870 --> 11:48.750
Let's all drink up together!

11:48.750 --> 11:50.200
Let's drink up together! Cheers!

11:50.200 --> 11:51.160
Bottoms up!

11:51.670 --> 11:52.530
Come on, Heizi.

11:53.000 --> 11:53.460
Come on.

11:53.640 --> 11:55.220
Fill it up. Fill it up.

11:55.550 --> 11:56.120
One more.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.720
Getting kicked out of our home

12:00.720 --> 12:02.120
on New Year's Eve...

12:03.320 --> 12:04.600
I'll figure something out
tomorrow morning

12:04.600 --> 12:05.630
and find us a place to stay,

12:05.630 --> 12:07.230
so Father won't feel too bad.

12:09.390 --> 12:10.240
Gu.

12:12.030 --> 12:13.030
Sorry about this.

12:14.370 --> 12:15.640
You guys saved my life.

12:16.510 --> 12:17.480
Don't worry.

12:17.610 --> 12:19.010
I'll think of something.

12:19.790 --> 12:21.390
What if there's no solution?

12:24.510 --> 12:26.240
Then we'll sleep on the street.

12:26.790 --> 12:27.910
I've already left Ningguta.

12:27.910 --> 12:28.630
For me,

12:28.650 --> 12:30.180
anywhere is a better place.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.870
Good wine should be enjoyed properly.

12:32.870 --> 12:33.320
Guys,

12:33.320 --> 12:34.270
drink up, drink up!

12:34.270 --> 12:34.790
Alright.

12:34.790 --> 12:35.200
I'll help Patriarch

12:35.200 --> 12:36.270
inside to rest for a while.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.450
D-Drink to your heart's content.

12:37.450 --> 12:40.260
I-I'm not drunk.

12:43.900 --> 12:45.500
Let's have a drink together.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.610
Scooch over.

12:54.860 --> 12:56.170
Come on, don't cry.

12:56.390 --> 12:59.190
How can I think of a solution
when you're like this?

12:59.290 --> 12:59.800
Then...

13:00.150 --> 13:01.030
Then I'll go somewhere else.

13:01.030 --> 13:02.360
That's not what I meant.

13:04.370 --> 13:05.740
Come take a walk with me.

13:06.480 --> 13:07.540
Get some fresh air.

13:07.670 --> 13:08.870
Show me around a bit.

13:11.120 --> 13:11.650
Let's go.

13:52.020 --> 13:53.750
Time to grab the gold ingots!

13:56.680 --> 13:57.940
Hurry up and grab some!

14:02.690 --> 14:03.750
You got some!

14:04.530 --> 14:06.060
I want some too!

14:09.130 --> 14:10.830
Come on, over here!

15:41.120 --> 15:42.150
When did you start
traveling with the horse gang

15:42.150 --> 15:43.440
alongside Mr. Chang?

15:44.340 --> 15:47.600
Around the age a little younger
than this kid,

15:47.920 --> 15:48.870
about 3 or 4.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.930
My mother passed away early.

15:50.930 --> 15:52.200
I kind of grew up

15:52.220 --> 15:54.280
swaying back and forth in carriages.

15:54.430 --> 15:55.430
That sounds nice.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.440
When I was little,

15:57.460 --> 15:59.060
I just studied in my village.

15:59.330 --> 16:00.550
The first time I traveled far

16:00.550 --> 16:03.200
was to the provincial capital
for the provincial exam.

16:03.200 --> 16:03.910
After that,

16:04.320 --> 16:06.320
I went to the capital
for the imperial exam,

16:06.320 --> 16:07.920
and then, I went to Ningguta.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.410
I really wish I could be like you,

16:09.410 --> 16:10.740
traveling everywhere.

16:12.690 --> 16:14.570
After being on the road for so long,

16:14.570 --> 16:16.830
you really start to miss staying at home.

16:17.260 --> 16:18.460
My father also said

16:18.750 --> 16:20.550
that sooner or later
he'll hang up his whip,

16:20.550 --> 16:21.550
sell the caravan,

16:21.790 --> 16:23.650
and enjoy his retirement at home.

16:27.030 --> 16:29.090
Does it snow often where you're from?

16:29.410 --> 16:30.170
Very rarely.

16:31.470 --> 16:32.930
My family are tea farmers.

16:33.270 --> 16:35.200
There's a tea mountain over there.

16:36.520 --> 16:37.390
If someday

16:37.390 --> 16:38.320
I can go back,

16:39.120 --> 16:40.000
I'll definitely treat you to

16:40.000 --> 16:41.660
the best tea from our Huizhou.

16:41.800 --> 16:42.910
That sounds wonderful,

16:42.910 --> 16:45.280
but I'm afraid I won't have such luck.

16:48.270 --> 16:48.670
You...

16:49.120 --> 16:50.650
Just consider me babbling.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.480
Gu,

16:52.150 --> 16:53.120
you're a lucky man blessed by heaven.

16:53.120 --> 16:54.790
You'll definitely make it back.

16:54.790 --> 16:56.200
I'm certainly blessed.

16:56.960 --> 16:58.150
It's thanks to the care
your family gave me

16:58.150 --> 16:59.680
that I've lived to this day.

16:59.840 --> 17:00.410
Don't worry.

17:00.410 --> 17:02.610
The house matter will turn out fine too.

17:03.140 --> 17:05.000
There's an outbreak of equine disease
on the Horqin Grasslands.

17:05.000 --> 17:05.839
Those in front, make way!

17:05.839 --> 17:07.000
His Highness needs to hire a horse gang

17:07.000 --> 17:07.880
to deliver medicine.

17:07.880 --> 17:08.510
Move aside!

17:08.510 --> 17:09.920
Who's willing to go?

17:09.960 --> 17:10.700
Make way!

17:11.510 --> 17:12.160
Move aside!

17:12.160 --> 17:14.400
There's an outbreak of equine disease
on the Horqin Grasslands.

17:14.400 --> 17:15.720
His Highness needs to hire a horse gang

17:15.720 --> 17:16.920
to deliver medicine.

17:17.109 --> 17:18.920
Who's willing to go?

17:20.310 --> 17:21.000
I've long heard that

17:21.000 --> 17:22.349
Pingyao is the wealthiest in the region.

17:22.349 --> 17:22.920
It's so late,

17:22.920 --> 17:24.400
yet there are still so many people
doing business.

17:24.400 --> 17:25.589
Those in front, make way!

17:25.589 --> 17:27.030
That's just how Pingyao is.

17:27.030 --> 17:29.130
Lots of horse gangs, draft banks,

17:29.200 --> 17:30.180
and pawnshops.

17:30.270 --> 17:31.430
Children

17:31.480 --> 17:33.050
who aren't cut out for studying

17:33.050 --> 17:35.040
are sent early to learn business.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.590
It's a pity I'm not a boy.

17:37.960 --> 17:38.920
Otherwise, I could also

17:38.920 --> 17:40.240
help my father with his business.

17:40.240 --> 17:42.350
There's an outbreak of equine disease
on the Horqin Grasslands.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.680
His Highness needs to hire a horse gang

17:43.680 --> 17:44.880
to deliver medicine.

17:44.880 --> 17:46.640
Who's willing to go?

17:47.090 --> 17:48.530
Come on, make way!

17:49.000 --> 17:49.510
Ms. Chang.

17:49.510 --> 17:50.720
Move aside! Don't block the way.

17:50.720 --> 17:52.180
I've thought of a solution

17:52.350 --> 17:53.720
to our current predicament.

17:53.720 --> 17:54.850
Are you interested?

17:58.030 --> 17:59.430
Those princes on the grasslands

17:59.430 --> 18:00.590
have started fighting.

18:00.590 --> 18:02.440
I heard they're fighting over pastures.

18:02.440 --> 18:04.400
They've sent people specifically
to buy medicine.

18:04.400 --> 18:05.740
They've already paid

18:05.790 --> 18:07.250
and are leaving tomorrow.

18:07.440 --> 18:08.290
Tomorrow?

18:08.480 --> 18:09.830
Even if I agreed to go tomorrow,

18:09.830 --> 18:11.690
my gang wouldn't go along with it.

18:11.930 --> 18:12.930
That's right.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.340
With all this chaos,

18:14.400 --> 18:15.140
once we get there,

18:15.140 --> 18:16.750
we won't even be able to
speak their language.

18:16.750 --> 18:17.400
Exactly.

18:17.780 --> 18:18.890
No, thank you.

18:23.790 --> 18:24.720
You are...

18:25.000 --> 18:26.480
I'm Chang Si's daughter.

18:28.080 --> 18:29.240
I've been looking for Mr. Chang.

18:29.240 --> 18:29.970
Is he here?

18:30.350 --> 18:30.960
He's drinking

18:30.960 --> 18:31.780
with his gang.

18:32.430 --> 18:33.760
I'm Mr. Chang's nephew.

18:34.440 --> 18:36.110
Mr. Chang asked me to deliver a message:

18:36.110 --> 18:37.030
this business deal,

18:37.030 --> 18:37.890
he's taking it.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.790
Mr. Chang is truly remarkable!

18:39.790 --> 18:40.400
Probably

18:40.420 --> 18:41.830
he really dares to go.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.320
Come here.

18:47.710 --> 18:49.570
This is not a matter to joke about.

18:49.830 --> 18:50.690
I'm not joking.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.900
Do you know where you'll be heading?

18:52.900 --> 18:54.290
Heading west this season,

18:53.520 --> 18:56.510
[Manager of the Horse Gang Office]

18:54.440 --> 18:55.590
you have to cross the Black Water Marsh

18:55.590 --> 18:57.310
and climb the Duozhe Mountains.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.400
Those mountains are so high

18:58.400 --> 19:00.070
that even birds can't fly over them.

19:00.070 --> 19:01.240
Today we invited so many

19:01.240 --> 19:02.330
horse gang people here,

19:02.330 --> 19:04.060
yet no one dares to take the job.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.040
I'll just pacify that Mongolian

19:06.110 --> 19:07.200
and try somewhere else

19:07.200 --> 19:07.930
tomorrow.

19:10.870 --> 19:11.550
You don't believe

19:11.550 --> 19:12.950
I can speak for Mr. Chang?

19:14.310 --> 19:15.020
This way, please.

19:15.020 --> 19:18.480
[Horse Gang Office]

19:16.440 --> 19:17.000
Come on.

19:18.570 --> 19:23.440
[Horse Gang Office]

19:33.800 --> 19:35.720
Liuzi, go sweep the stable.

19:35.750 --> 19:37.640
Especially over there,
clean it thoroughly.

19:37.640 --> 19:39.370
It's cold, so add extra fodder.

19:40.030 --> 19:40.880
Mr. Zeng.

19:41.270 --> 19:42.690
Check the horseshoes

19:42.750 --> 19:44.280
and get someone to help you.

19:44.310 --> 19:44.960
Alright!

19:49.110 --> 19:50.440
Please take a look carefully.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.980
This agreement states

19:50.560 --> 19:52.170
[If not repaid in full within this year,
ancestral house mortgaged to Wang Tiangui]

19:52.340 --> 19:54.410
if it isn't repaid in full
within this year,

19:54.320 --> 19:57.130
[Loan Agreement]
[Borrower: Chang Si, Lender: Wang Tiangui]

19:54.550 --> 19:57.400
your house will be mortgaged to Master.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.450
How much short?

19:58.830 --> 20:01.200
718 taels.

20:23.360 --> 20:27.270
[500 taels]

20:33.520 --> 20:34.240
Yu'er!

20:42.590 --> 20:43.110
Father.

20:43.550 --> 20:44.350
You're awake.

20:45.600 --> 20:46.640
Where did this money

20:46.640 --> 20:47.440
come from?

21:01.870 --> 21:02.580
Everyone.

21:03.220 --> 21:04.370
There's something

21:05.000 --> 21:06.270
I must tell you all.

21:07.500 --> 21:08.960
Mr. Chang still owes money

21:09.070 --> 21:10.030
for this house.

21:11.310 --> 21:13.160
If we can't pay the full amount today,

21:13.160 --> 21:14.890
Wang Tiangui will take it away,

21:15.270 --> 21:16.740
and Mr. Chang and his family

21:16.740 --> 21:18.200
will be out on the streets.

21:20.200 --> 21:20.720
What's happening?

21:20.720 --> 21:21.790
I took the liberty

21:22.590 --> 21:24.350
of accepting a job
to deliver medicinal herbs

21:24.350 --> 21:25.480
to the Horqin Grasslands.

21:25.480 --> 21:27.010
Please have a seat, you two.

21:30.160 --> 21:32.020
Have you talked business before?

21:32.790 --> 21:33.980
Just play it by ear.

21:34.420 --> 21:35.660
Have a good talk.

21:37.660 --> 21:38.590
Hanlong, right?

21:39.730 --> 21:40.790
I'll talk with you.

21:41.360 --> 21:43.090
Any conditions I can agree to,

21:43.350 --> 21:44.610
Mr. Chang Si will certainly agree to
as well.

21:44.610 --> 21:46.570
I know Mr. Chang.

21:44.900 --> 21:47.350
[Mongolian Traveling Merchant: Hanlong]

21:47.680 --> 21:49.920
He used to travel to western Mongolia
quite often.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.830
Our prince knows him too.

21:52.110 --> 21:53.070
He's a good man.

21:53.250 --> 21:54.020
Come on,

21:55.660 --> 21:56.390
have a drink.

22:00.200 --> 22:01.360
You're a real man.

22:01.380 --> 22:03.180
You can really hold your liquor.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.000
Here.

22:07.510 --> 22:08.070
Here.

22:11.240 --> 22:11.750
Here.

22:12.070 --> 22:13.720
All the Han merchants

22:13.720 --> 22:14.920
are received by me.

22:15.110 --> 22:15.780
From now on,

22:15.920 --> 22:17.650
just treat me as one of your own.

22:18.000 --> 22:18.510
Sure.

22:19.110 --> 22:20.510
Thank you for your hospitality.

22:20.510 --> 22:21.030
I still don't know

22:21.030 --> 22:23.430
what medicine you're planning to deliver.

22:25.110 --> 22:25.750
Father.

22:26.640 --> 22:28.330
Say something, please.

22:28.520 --> 22:31.450
Why are you just pacing around
without saying a word?

22:32.430 --> 22:34.580
Is this the solution you came up for me?

22:35.000 --> 22:36.000
It wasn't me.

22:36.020 --> 22:37.090
It was Gu.

22:37.160 --> 22:37.790
He...

22:38.070 --> 22:38.790
He...

22:39.200 --> 22:40.070
He...

22:40.830 --> 22:41.440
He...

22:41.630 --> 22:43.720
He's never even worked with a horse gang!

22:43.720 --> 22:45.160
He's just a scholar.

22:45.220 --> 22:46.950
How could you agree to his plan?

22:46.960 --> 22:47.660
If I didn't agree,

22:47.660 --> 22:48.760
what, should we just wait

22:48.760 --> 22:50.340
to be kicked out tonight?

22:50.510 --> 22:52.770
Where are we going to get that much money?

22:53.480 --> 22:55.330
I've never been to western Mongolia,

22:55.330 --> 22:56.930
and I don't know much about that place.

22:56.930 --> 22:58.660
But there's a saying from my hometown.

22:58.660 --> 23:00.110
It goes "1,000 miles or 10,000 miles,

23:00.110 --> 23:03.240
as long as you start walking,
you'll eventually reach your destination."

23:03.240 --> 23:04.150
It means

23:04.640 --> 23:06.110
no matter how far the journey is,

23:06.110 --> 23:07.430
as long as you take the first step,

23:07.430 --> 23:09.270
you'll definitely reach your destination!

23:09.270 --> 23:11.230
This money is like a hot potato!

23:11.760 --> 23:13.770
There's a war going on in Horqin.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.610
It's too dangerous to go there!

23:16.510 --> 23:17.970
Didn't you say it yourself

23:19.680 --> 23:21.640
that fortune favors the brave?

23:47.110 --> 23:48.370
You must be lying to me.

23:50.400 --> 23:52.330
He doesn't know business at all.

23:52.540 --> 23:55.000
How could he possibly
have closed this deal?

23:55.480 --> 23:56.210
I taught him.

23:56.640 --> 23:57.550
This won't do.

23:58.360 --> 23:59.680
60 days at most.

24:02.590 --> 24:03.580
Well...

24:04.930 --> 24:07.190
When I traveled with my father in summer,

24:07.400 --> 24:09.480
it took at least two and a half months.

24:09.550 --> 24:10.230
Exactly.

24:10.480 --> 24:11.740
And that was in summer.

24:12.490 --> 24:13.540
This time,

24:14.000 --> 24:15.170
with snow and wind,

24:15.680 --> 24:17.650
plus climbing the Duozhe Mountains

24:17.650 --> 24:19.650
and crossing the Black Water Marsh,

24:19.880 --> 24:20.740
and on the road,

24:21.040 --> 24:23.040
we may not even be able to find an inn.

24:23.330 --> 24:24.730
I'd say it's impossible.

24:26.510 --> 24:28.110
What do you mean by that?

24:28.310 --> 24:30.030
This deadline was set by His Highness.

24:30.030 --> 24:31.360
Let alone His Highness,

24:31.640 --> 24:32.590
even if it's God himself demanding it,

24:32.590 --> 24:33.400
what can we do?

24:33.590 --> 24:35.190
We're not deities after all.

24:36.070 --> 24:37.150
Please find someone else.

24:37.150 --> 24:37.880
I'm leaving.

24:38.270 --> 24:39.400
Bro, bro, wait!

24:40.890 --> 24:42.960
Since we're talking business,

24:43.000 --> 24:45.160
we need to negotiate, right?

24:48.110 --> 24:49.180
Sit, sit.

24:49.370 --> 24:50.400
Since you've drunk

24:50.400 --> 24:51.590
the Mongols' wine,

24:51.680 --> 24:53.220
that makes you a brother of the Mongols.

24:53.220 --> 24:54.510
Let's settle this matter quickly

24:54.510 --> 24:56.040
so I can report back sooner,

24:56.160 --> 24:56.940
right?

25:01.830 --> 25:03.180
As for the timing,

25:03.640 --> 25:05.480
at most I can give you
an extension of 10 more days.

25:05.480 --> 25:06.690
Just travel faster.

25:06.750 --> 25:08.000
As for the horse gang's travel fee,

25:08.000 --> 25:09.060
I can pay a bit more.

25:16.120 --> 25:17.000
Well...

25:18.070 --> 25:19.160
Since

25:19.960 --> 25:21.920
you can pay higher travel fees,

25:22.400 --> 25:23.680
I think God

25:23.700 --> 25:25.300
will also show us some favor.

25:27.950 --> 25:28.750
If this medicine

25:28.750 --> 25:29.590
can't be delivered

25:29.590 --> 25:30.310
before the hot weather sets in

25:30.310 --> 25:31.650
and we lose the battle,

25:32.150 --> 25:32.880
the pastures

25:33.170 --> 25:33.900
and the women

25:34.250 --> 25:34.960
will all be gone.

25:34.960 --> 25:35.850
When that happens, His Highness

25:35.850 --> 25:37.790
will surely have my head.

25:37.960 --> 25:39.200
So you're saying

25:39.220 --> 25:40.960
whether you get to keep your head

25:40.960 --> 25:42.020
depends on whether

25:42.030 --> 25:44.030
our horse gang travels fast enough.

25:45.000 --> 25:46.000
Here's the thing.

25:46.430 --> 25:47.360
Those in our gang

25:47.380 --> 25:48.780
will be hard to convince.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.190
It's the New Year after all.

25:50.190 --> 25:51.540
Nobody wants to risk

25:51.570 --> 25:52.830
their lives out there.

25:53.510 --> 25:54.310
Unless...

25:54.720 --> 25:56.030
Before they leave,

25:56.740 --> 25:58.000
we give them an advance payment.

25:58.000 --> 25:58.600
No, no, no.

25:58.620 --> 26:00.040
To put their minds at ease.

26:00.040 --> 26:02.280
And you'll be the one to pay this money.

26:02.550 --> 26:03.510
Bro,

26:04.070 --> 26:05.990
your way of negotiation is improper.

26:05.990 --> 26:06.590
Improper?

26:06.780 --> 26:07.660
Improper.

26:07.790 --> 26:08.830
If you're dead,

26:09.850 --> 26:11.850
who are you going to talk rules with?

26:12.540 --> 26:14.540
Let me tell you what the real rule is:

26:14.660 --> 26:16.310
get the medicine delivered
as quickly as possible,

26:16.310 --> 26:17.690
your people stay safe,

26:17.720 --> 26:19.070
my people stay safe—

26:19.240 --> 26:20.330
first make sure

26:20.360 --> 26:21.320
your head stays on your shoulders.

26:21.320 --> 26:23.250
Only then will you have a life to spend
whatever money you earn.

26:23.250 --> 26:24.220
That is the greatest rule

26:24.220 --> 26:25.120
under heaven.

26:28.420 --> 26:29.360
You two

26:29.680 --> 26:31.210
are quite the negotiators.

26:35.780 --> 26:36.860
Add 20% to the travel fee,

26:36.860 --> 26:37.990
and I'll go with you.

26:38.220 --> 26:39.110
That's right!

26:39.140 --> 26:40.330
I'm not married anyway.

26:40.330 --> 26:43.130
I'll just make some money
so I can get myself a wife.

26:43.760 --> 26:45.160
What are you laughing at?

26:46.180 --> 26:48.380
Mr. Chang makes the call on this matter.

26:48.410 --> 26:49.830
You have no say in this!

26:55.950 --> 26:56.790
Mr. Chang.

26:56.900 --> 26:58.700
-Mr. Chang.
-Mr. Chang.

27:02.210 --> 27:03.130
Mr. Gu's decision

27:03.130 --> 27:04.130
is my decision.

27:11.310 --> 27:11.910
Come here.

27:14.810 --> 27:15.980
Today, I, Chang Si,

27:17.480 --> 27:19.140
am facing some difficulties.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.320
Let me just say one thing:

27:21.870 --> 27:23.330
whether you help me or not,

27:23.840 --> 27:25.440
I'll be grateful either way.

27:25.970 --> 27:27.230
In our circle, we value

27:27.530 --> 27:28.740
keeping our word

27:28.760 --> 27:30.420
and standing by our promises.

27:30.430 --> 27:31.220
Today,

27:31.610 --> 27:33.010
I'm asking for your help.

27:33.090 --> 27:34.290
I'm not backing down.

27:34.430 --> 27:35.280
Mr. Chang, we'll go too.

27:35.280 --> 27:37.410
-Mr. Chang, we'll go too.
-I'll go too.

27:38.880 --> 27:39.740
After the meal,

27:39.990 --> 27:41.190
everyone go home

27:41.220 --> 27:42.540
and talk to your families.

27:42.540 --> 27:44.570
I won't believe promises made now.

27:44.920 --> 27:46.580
Come back after your families

27:46.720 --> 27:47.790
have given their approval.

27:47.790 --> 27:48.720
Your travel fees

27:49.070 --> 27:50.670
will all be increased by 20%.

27:51.350 --> 27:52.510
Thank you, Mr. Chang.

27:52.510 --> 27:53.630
Mr. Chang, you're so generous!

27:53.630 --> 27:54.480
-Thank you, Mr. Chang.
-Thank you, Mr. Chang.

27:54.480 --> 27:55.140
Please sit.

27:58.220 --> 27:58.890
Liuzi.

27:59.400 --> 28:00.090
Mr. Chang.

28:00.590 --> 28:01.850
You're getting married after we come back.

28:01.850 --> 28:03.630
I'm waiting to have a drink
at your wedding.

28:03.630 --> 28:05.040
No problem. No problem.

28:05.530 --> 28:06.590
Come on, let's eat.

28:07.250 --> 28:07.830
Come on.

28:07.880 --> 28:08.720
Let's eat.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.270
Mr. Chang.

28:27.200 --> 28:29.640
My dear Mr. Chang.

28:30.690 --> 28:32.720
You've honored us with your presence.

28:32.720 --> 28:34.590
I apologize for not greeting you properly.

28:34.590 --> 28:36.650
I should have been the one to visit you

28:36.720 --> 28:38.630
and pay my respects in person.

28:38.730 --> 28:41.130
Waiting for you to kick me
out of my own home?

28:41.900 --> 28:43.190
Mr. Chang.

28:43.730 --> 28:45.140
That phrase "kick out"

28:45.170 --> 28:46.300
is not appropriate.

28:46.490 --> 28:48.580
Everyone knows that you, Mr. Chang,

28:48.610 --> 28:49.770
are a respected elder

28:49.770 --> 28:51.200
here in Pingyao.

28:51.440 --> 28:52.070
Besides,

28:52.090 --> 28:54.200
we've been doing business
for so many years.

28:54.200 --> 28:55.200
I'm a man

28:55.550 --> 28:57.480
who always abides by the rules.

28:57.570 --> 28:59.980
I just didn't want to break the rules

29:00.370 --> 29:02.540
and make you unhappy, Mr. Chang.

29:06.200 --> 29:06.830
Mr. Chang,

29:07.610 --> 29:09.230
about tonight's matter,

29:09.680 --> 29:11.110
I've made a decision.

29:11.370 --> 29:15.050
How about our two families get together

29:15.150 --> 29:17.140
and celebrate the New Year joyfully?

29:17.140 --> 29:19.230
After the Lantern Festival,

29:19.400 --> 29:20.380
you can sell off

29:20.410 --> 29:21.740
your caravan business.

29:22.100 --> 29:24.410
You should invest in
some salt fields instead.

29:24.410 --> 29:26.280
That's the real business.

29:31.880 --> 29:32.840
This is...

29:33.950 --> 29:36.970
[400 taels]

29:34.220 --> 29:35.970
Notes from the Four Major Banks.

29:35.970 --> 29:37.310
Let's settle the accounts.

29:37.310 --> 29:38.110
Wang Tiangui.

29:38.830 --> 29:40.670
God is watching up there.

29:40.700 --> 29:43.100
I, Chang Si, haven't broken any agreement.

29:56.750 --> 29:58.080
Go have these verified.

30:28.810 --> 30:29.620
[Payment to Chang Si:
1,000 taels of silver]

30:33.650 --> 30:34.520
Mr. Chang.

30:35.460 --> 30:36.660
Getting this money

30:36.830 --> 30:38.800
didn't cause you any hardship, did it?

30:38.800 --> 30:39.880
Living in this world,

30:39.880 --> 30:41.480
who doesn't face hardships?

30:41.880 --> 30:43.070
Just sign it.

30:42.910 --> 30:43.930
[Borrower: Chang Si]

30:48.070 --> 30:48.910
[Payment to Chang Si:
1,000 taels of silver]

31:02.730 --> 31:03.440
Mr. Chang,

31:04.330 --> 31:06.980
here's the remaining payment
for the small shop

31:06.980 --> 31:09.140
and your previous property deed.

31:09.300 --> 31:11.500
They've been ready for quite some time.

31:12.370 --> 31:13.700
Please accept them.

31:34.440 --> 31:38.310
My congratulations then, Mr. Chang.

31:38.740 --> 31:41.010
I wish you an early happy new year.

31:41.170 --> 31:42.930
Wish you great prosperity

31:42.960 --> 31:44.470
and thriving business.

31:44.630 --> 31:45.930
If you ever need anything

31:45.930 --> 31:47.340
from our small shop,

31:47.840 --> 31:49.200
just say the word.

31:51.870 --> 31:54.120
I wish you prosperity as well.

31:54.140 --> 31:54.870
Sure, sure.

31:55.010 --> 31:56.820
Do some good deeds
and accumulate some virtue.

31:56.820 --> 31:57.950
Before you die,

31:58.270 --> 31:59.450
have a child or two.

31:59.850 --> 32:01.160
As the saying goes,

32:01.310 --> 32:02.350
a grave is like an earthen bun,

32:02.350 --> 32:03.550
and the person inside is the filling.

32:03.550 --> 32:05.700
You may have mountains of gold and silver
while alive,

32:05.700 --> 32:06.480
but after death,

32:06.480 --> 32:08.110
you won't even have someone
to burn incense for you.

32:08.110 --> 32:09.240
Being a poor ghost

32:09.880 --> 32:10.940
won't be pleasant.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.430
I'm leaving.

32:14.550 --> 32:15.090
You...

32:26.690 --> 32:28.030
Master, please calm down.

32:28.030 --> 32:29.550
Your hands got cold.

32:29.820 --> 32:30.820
Calm down please.

32:32.720 --> 32:33.960
Chang Si!

32:33.980 --> 32:36.110
I'll kill you!

32:36.140 --> 32:39.410
He dared to call me childless!

32:40.640 --> 32:42.960
I'll kill him!

32:44.510 --> 32:45.230
And...

32:45.800 --> 32:47.350
And that guy next to him.

32:47.880 --> 32:48.910
He clearly doesn't look like

32:48.910 --> 32:49.950
a scholar.

32:49.970 --> 32:50.430
No.

32:51.540 --> 32:52.640
He has the appearance

32:52.640 --> 32:53.880
of a scholar.

32:54.940 --> 32:56.930
I smelt something.

32:57.390 --> 33:00.050
That scent of his was a bit strange.

33:00.900 --> 33:02.090
Go investigate him.

33:02.780 --> 33:05.370
Hurry up and investigate him!

33:06.970 --> 33:07.970
Please calm down.

33:21.410 --> 33:23.350
With auspiciousness, we travel the world.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.380
Wealth keeps us safe.

33:25.530 --> 33:27.340
With auspiciousness, we travel the world.

33:25.600 --> 33:27.050
[Jixiang Caravan][Chang]

33:27.360 --> 33:29.190
Wealth keeps us safe.

33:31.610 --> 33:32.410
Guys,

33:32.940 --> 33:34.000
let's hit the road!

33:35.580 --> 33:39.020
[Medicine]

33:44.130 --> 33:45.040
Mr. Gu,

33:46.110 --> 33:46.750
I didn't expect

33:46.750 --> 33:48.360
you to close a deal

33:48.390 --> 33:50.320
on your very first try at business.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.400
I'm truly impressed.

33:53.440 --> 33:54.270
On this journey,

33:53.770 --> 33:58.110
[Ying Xun]

33:54.310 --> 33:55.920
we'll be traveling for a long time.

33:55.920 --> 33:58.160
Let's take our time to discuss
business strategies.

33:58.160 --> 33:58.960
Of course.

34:02.330 --> 34:04.180
I hope this is the last time

34:04.200 --> 34:05.530
we have to travel so far.

34:41.280 --> 34:42.190
Master.

34:47.870 --> 34:48.960
That foreign monk

34:49.000 --> 34:50.969
is quite a good painter.

34:50.989 --> 34:52.770
I gave him 5 taels of silver.

34:52.790 --> 34:54.260
He's easily impressed

34:54.280 --> 34:56.080
and kept thanking me profusely.

34:56.699 --> 34:57.760
By the way, Master.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.190
I found out something

34:59.210 --> 35:00.810
that will surely please you.

35:02.470 --> 35:03.590
This man

35:03.670 --> 35:04.590
is surnamed Gu,

35:05.420 --> 35:07.010
and his name is Gu Pingyuan.

35:07.670 --> 35:09.730
He followed them here from Ningguta.

35:11.750 --> 35:13.250
Ningguta?

35:15.210 --> 35:16.250
That has been our dynasty's

35:16.250 --> 35:18.520
place of exile for over 200 years.

35:19.480 --> 35:20.400
Could he be...

35:20.420 --> 35:22.010
Who knows?

35:29.320 --> 35:31.800
Ningguta.

35:34.860 --> 35:37.620
[Duozhe Mountains]

35:39.810 --> 35:40.350
Let's go!

35:42.150 --> 35:43.750
Those in the back, follow up!

35:47.030 --> 35:47.840
Let's go!

35:48.110 --> 35:48.540
One!

35:48.710 --> 35:49.190
Two!

35:49.470 --> 35:51.870
[Medicine]

35:49.630 --> 35:50.630
Push!

35:51.150 --> 35:51.730
One!

35:51.910 --> 35:52.350
Two!

35:52.550 --> 35:54.110
Push!

35:55.440 --> 35:56.710
Push!

36:00.110 --> 36:01.440
Guys,

36:01.620 --> 36:04.130
once we get past this windy pass,
it'll be better!

36:04.130 --> 36:06.970
After crossing the mountains,
we'll rest in the valley!

36:06.970 --> 36:08.660
Let's all push harder!

36:09.510 --> 36:11.940
One, two, push!

36:12.360 --> 36:13.230
One!

36:13.590 --> 36:14.850
One, two!

36:14.980 --> 36:16.140
Push!

36:17.840 --> 36:18.710
Hurry!

36:19.350 --> 36:20.290
One, two!

36:20.630 --> 36:22.590
Push! Push!

36:23.230 --> 36:24.070
Faster!

36:24.470 --> 36:26.000
Once we get past this slope,

36:27.150 --> 36:28.080
it'll be easier!

36:33.760 --> 36:36.960
After crossing the mountains,
we'll rest in the valley!

36:39.590 --> 36:40.850
Put your backs into it!

36:52.320 --> 36:52.940
Here, have more.

36:52.940 --> 36:53.690
No, no more.

36:53.820 --> 36:55.040
This whets your appetite.

36:55.040 --> 36:56.490
I've never been able to handle spicy food
since childhood.

36:56.490 --> 36:57.450
Even this level of spiciness,

36:57.450 --> 36:59.150
I only built up the tolerance for it
back in Ningguta.

36:59.150 --> 37:00.280
Actually, I still haven't gotten used to

37:00.280 --> 37:02.210
eating this pot helmet flatbread.

37:03.070 --> 37:03.870
You know what?

37:04.320 --> 37:05.900
The elders say this pot helmet flatbread

37:05.900 --> 37:07.320
was the Qin Dynasty soldiers' rations.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.230
The soldiers

37:09.070 --> 37:10.530
would mix flour with water

37:10.540 --> 37:11.970
and roll it into a big flatbread,

37:11.970 --> 37:13.630
placing it over their helmets

37:13.670 --> 37:15.000
and cooking it directly

37:15.000 --> 37:15.880
over the fire.

37:16.810 --> 37:17.800
It wasn't very large,

37:17.800 --> 37:18.590
but it was filling,

37:18.590 --> 37:19.250
which is why

37:19.520 --> 37:21.540
it got the name "pot helmet flatbread."

37:21.540 --> 37:22.720
You won't find knowledge like this

37:22.720 --> 37:23.570
in books.

37:23.590 --> 37:24.390
That's right.

37:32.060 --> 37:33.540
Is your leg hurting, Patriarch?

37:33.540 --> 37:34.140
It's fine.

37:36.110 --> 37:36.550
Heizi.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.540
Tomorrow morning,

37:38.840 --> 37:40.840
send two men ahead to clear the path.

37:41.590 --> 37:42.640
This blizzard

37:42.670 --> 37:43.880
won't stop anytime soon.

37:43.880 --> 37:44.820
If the path isn't cleared properly,

37:44.820 --> 37:46.150
the main group shouldn't move.

37:46.150 --> 37:47.320
But we're moving so slowly

37:47.320 --> 37:48.090
that we're already behind schedule

37:48.090 --> 37:48.930
by 2 days.

37:49.510 --> 37:52.370
Human life is the most precious thing
under heaven.

37:52.760 --> 37:54.050
So what if we're behind the schedule
by 2 days?

37:54.050 --> 37:55.000
I'll be the one cracking the whip.

37:55.000 --> 37:56.260
What are you afraid of?

37:56.330 --> 37:58.730
We can't afford even the slightest mishap.

37:59.090 --> 38:01.150
Alright, I'll go make arrangements.

38:08.550 --> 38:10.110
How was your holiday?

38:11.110 --> 38:12.830
Just so-so.

38:14.150 --> 38:16.350
The war in the south is getting intense.

38:17.590 --> 38:21.520
The imperial court is raising rents
and taxes under various pretexts.

38:22.810 --> 38:25.430
Food from the south
cannot be transported here.

38:25.430 --> 38:26.880
Once the weather gets cold,

38:26.880 --> 38:30.450
more people will starve to death this year
than in previous years.

38:30.450 --> 38:31.960
I came to tell you

38:33.550 --> 38:34.550
the time has come.

38:44.670 --> 38:46.050
In the south,

38:46.190 --> 38:48.150
the biggest problem isn't
the military situation,

38:48.150 --> 38:49.150
but the economy.

38:49.750 --> 38:51.550
The imperial court
has been defeated so many times,

38:51.550 --> 38:52.800
but each time, they managed to

38:52.800 --> 38:54.560
rebuild their army immediately.

38:54.560 --> 38:55.820
Why could they do that?

38:55.880 --> 38:57.480
It's because they have taxes,

38:57.480 --> 38:58.470
draft banks,

38:58.800 --> 38:59.660
and pawnshops.

39:00.400 --> 39:01.850
Money

39:02.430 --> 39:03.460
is completely useless

39:03.460 --> 39:04.860
if it doesn't circulate.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.590
I've been tasked

39:06.920 --> 39:09.670
to reorganize the financial circulation
in Jiangnan.

39:09.670 --> 39:11.290
Running draft banks and pawnshops

39:11.290 --> 39:12.950
requires skilled personnel.

39:15.030 --> 39:15.960
In that case,

39:15.980 --> 39:18.040
I really need to make a trip to Shanxi.

39:18.160 --> 39:19.070
That place

39:19.140 --> 39:20.870
is the treasury of the Qing Dynasty.

39:20.870 --> 39:23.400
The Eight Major Shanxi Merchant Families
have been

39:23.400 --> 39:25.150
prospering there
since the previous dynasty.

39:25.150 --> 39:27.610
For 300 years, they've accumulated wealth.

39:28.510 --> 39:29.640
And now,

39:29.840 --> 39:32.840
they've even monopolized
the draft banking business.

39:32.840 --> 39:33.900
After the New Year,

39:34.280 --> 39:36.030
you'll open your own
draft banks and pawnshops

39:36.030 --> 39:37.360
in the Pingyao area

39:37.590 --> 39:39.520
under the Li family name,

39:39.690 --> 39:41.150
mainly to recruit talent.

39:43.510 --> 39:44.740
Didn't I say

39:45.320 --> 39:47.920
no one is allowed to come in
even if the sky falls?

39:47.920 --> 39:48.480
Father.

39:48.920 --> 39:50.320
Ms. Su is here too, right?

39:59.760 --> 40:00.320
Ms. Su.

40:01.070 --> 40:01.530
Father.

40:01.730 --> 40:03.060
What are you doing here?

40:03.230 --> 40:04.230
How did you know

40:04.250 --> 40:05.330
Ms. Su was here?

40:05.380 --> 40:07.400
Zhang Guangfa is cleaning up the back door
with some people.

40:07.400 --> 40:07.880
Tonight,

40:07.880 --> 40:09.040
he's guarding it himself.

40:09.040 --> 40:09.730
So I knew

40:09.960 --> 40:10.550
there must be an important guest

40:10.550 --> 40:11.730
visiting our family tonight.

40:11.730 --> 40:12.730
Is execution and confiscation
coming too slowly

40:12.730 --> 40:13.200
for you?

40:13.480 --> 40:13.760
I...

40:13.760 --> 40:14.690
Young Master Li.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.400
She's calling me.

40:17.360 --> 40:17.920
Ms. Su.

40:18.280 --> 40:19.550
Where are you planning to go?

40:19.550 --> 40:20.480
I'll go with you.

40:21.800 --> 40:23.460
I'm going to the Pingyao area.

40:23.510 --> 40:24.480
Your Li family is going to establish

40:24.480 --> 40:25.920
your own draft banks and pawnshops,

40:25.920 --> 40:28.390
and your father will
personally accompany me.

40:28.390 --> 40:29.250
There's no need

40:30.110 --> 40:31.320
to trouble my father with this.

40:31.320 --> 40:32.450
I'll go in his place.

40:32.920 --> 40:33.380
Father,

40:34.150 --> 40:36.030
I'll pave a way for you,

40:36.150 --> 40:37.050
so as to prevent any potential damage

40:37.050 --> 40:38.080
to your reputation.

40:38.080 --> 40:39.880
What do you know, you little kid?

40:40.320 --> 40:41.120
In this world,

40:41.130 --> 40:43.000
who would ever make way for others?

40:43.000 --> 40:43.400
I...

40:43.670 --> 40:44.880
If you can really

40:44.900 --> 40:46.860
hold on for a year

40:46.920 --> 40:47.960
in Shanxi,

40:47.990 --> 40:49.710
that would be quite an achievement.

40:49.710 --> 40:51.240
Do you dare to go, young man?

40:53.090 --> 40:54.320
If I'm allowed to go,

40:55.230 --> 40:56.910
I'll definitely put down roots there.

40:56.910 --> 40:58.500
Children of Shanxi merchants

40:58.500 --> 41:00.180
learn business from childhood.

41:00.180 --> 41:03.340
They start as errand boys,
sweeping floors and pouring water.

41:03.340 --> 41:04.590
Without decades of experience,

41:04.590 --> 41:05.570
how could anyone possibly

41:05.570 --> 41:06.520
take the position of a shopkeeper there?

41:06.520 --> 41:07.460
Just look at you.

41:07.550 --> 41:08.620
Anyone can tell you're just

41:08.620 --> 41:09.520
a spoiled rich kid

41:09.520 --> 41:10.570
playing around.

41:10.920 --> 41:11.920
No, Father, I...

41:13.470 --> 41:15.180
I actually think

41:15.880 --> 41:18.110
it would be good for Young Master Li
to go.

41:18.110 --> 41:18.960
The renowned

41:19.000 --> 41:20.430
Li Wantang making a move

41:20.450 --> 41:22.260
would stir up too much attention.

41:22.260 --> 41:23.250
Many things

41:23.710 --> 41:25.400
would become difficult to handle.

41:25.400 --> 41:26.130
Thanks a lot.

41:26.410 --> 41:26.870
Father,

41:27.030 --> 41:28.350
this time, I'll definitely control

41:28.350 --> 41:29.100
my bad habits

41:29.220 --> 41:30.320
and work diligently

41:30.320 --> 41:32.450
to make something of myself in Shanxi.

41:33.660 --> 41:34.980
If you can get my business done,

41:34.980 --> 41:36.640
I'll give you the heads of
Shanxi's Eight Families

41:36.640 --> 41:37.850
as a reward.

41:38.110 --> 41:39.600
Just a few shops

41:40.000 --> 41:42.130
won't cause any major embarrassment.

41:44.250 --> 41:45.180
Young Master Li,

41:45.670 --> 41:46.610
there's another interesting matter

41:46.610 --> 41:47.710
I should tell you about.

41:47.710 --> 41:48.630
Your old friend

41:48.650 --> 41:50.050
is currently in Pingyao.

41:50.900 --> 41:51.380
Who?

41:51.570 --> 41:52.890
That scholar from Ningguta,

41:52.890 --> 41:53.690
Gu Pingyuan.

41:53.950 --> 41:55.980
Gu Pingyuan escaped to Shanxi?

41:57.250 --> 41:58.250
How did you know?

41:58.480 --> 42:00.080
I have plenty of informants.

42:00.290 --> 42:01.680
That Gu guy,

42:01.790 --> 42:02.640
I need to find a way

42:02.640 --> 42:03.900
to bring him over here.

42:04.630 --> 42:05.490
Heaven created

42:05.490 --> 42:06.520
such a talented person,

42:06.520 --> 42:08.110
yet he's fallen to such a state.

42:08.110 --> 42:09.670
If this imperial court doesn't fall,

42:09.670 --> 42:11.130
there truly is no justice.

42:11.490 --> 42:14.290
There are plenty of talented people
in this world.

42:14.800 --> 42:15.590
That guy

42:15.610 --> 42:16.950
is nothing but

42:16.970 --> 42:18.210
a fugitive exile.

42:18.240 --> 42:19.690
What kind of talent is that?

42:19.690 --> 42:22.070
Ms. Su, you're exaggerating.

42:22.440 --> 42:23.390
You know him?

42:23.470 --> 42:24.190
I don't.

42:24.330 --> 42:25.790
My son mentioned him once.

42:27.040 --> 42:27.830
How could he possibly

42:27.830 --> 42:29.020
have escaped alive?

42:29.580 --> 42:30.990
Yes, I'm puzzled too.

42:31.120 --> 42:32.230
When I get to Shanxi,

42:32.230 --> 42:32.960
I'll ask him.

42:32.980 --> 42:34.150
Your status is noble.

42:34.150 --> 42:35.380
How could you associate with an exile?

42:35.380 --> 42:37.110
Well, Ms. Su herself is a reb...

42:55.500 --> 42:56.480
You mean rebel?
